# Feral Infected role and objectives
feral-infected-role-name = Feral Infected
feral-infected-role-objective = Unleash the disease. Claw and tear your way through the crew.
feral-infected-infect-popup = You feel a searing, biological heat in your hands as your flesh twists into claws... YOU ARE INFECTED.
feral-infected-briefing = The silent virus has taken control. Your mind slips away, and your hands have hardened into claws you cannot remove. You must kill.
feral-infected-round-end-agent-name = feral infected

# Objective Issuer
objective-issuer-feral-infected = Feral Instincts

# Sanity slip alerts
feral-infected-sanity-1 = Wait, what am I doing? These people are my friends...
feral-infected-sanity-2 = The blood... why is it on my hands?
feral-infected-sanity-3 = I need to stop... but the hunger...
feral-infected-sanity-4 = They are looking at my hands. Hide them. HIDE THEM.
feral-infected-sanity-5 = Make it stop... make the voices stop!
feral-infected-sanity-6 = Why did I do that? That wasn't me...

# Hunger and Feeding
feral-infected-hungry-1 = I need to feed... the hunger is tearing me apart!
feral-infected-hungry-2 = FLESH... I MUST CONSUME FLESH!
feral-infected-hungry-3 = They look so delicious... I want to tear them open and feed...
feral-infected-hungry-4 = My hands are shaking... the virus wants to eat...

feral-infected-eating-start = You begin tearing into the corpse, devouring the flesh...
feral-infected-eating-success = You devour the corpse, satisfying your dark hunger!
feral-infected-eating-others = {THE($user)} viciously tears into the corpse, devouring it!

# Ascension
feral-infected-ascended-popup = THE VIRUS HAS COMPLETELY OVERTAKEN YOU. YOU HAVE ASCENDED. Your flesh twists and shifts as you mutate into a grotesque Feral Parasite, ready to lay waste to the station!
feral-infected-ascended-announcement-title = {$player} Announcement
feral-infected-ascended-announcement = I look to my left, my sanity gone, not caring to look to the right. It was always there, along with me... I was *always* here, and it was also with me. I look down at my hands. They aren't hands anymore... they are still claws. Suddenly, my body contorts into a twisted shape. "This isn't me," my sanity whispers, repeating... until all gets hushed. **It's finally just the parasite.**



